triage:C5_QA2_QA_C5_008 a triage:Finding ;
 triage:id "QA-C5-008" ;
 triage:severity "important" ;
 triage:reviewer "rust-qa-agent" ;
 triage:status "implemented_pending_qa" ;
 triage:reviewed_commit "f676f940af81b09315366feb4ca644b86a3d2485" ;
 triage:file "crates/sc-cron/src/sqlite_cooperative_lifecycle_tests.rs" ;
 triage:issue "The ordinary-thread stop regression can falsely pass without any future notifier when the spawned thread starts after its precomputed 25ms grace cutoff." ;
 triage:action "Use a causal future-notifier arm/branch witness or controlled clock/wake seam before advancing expiry, while retaining native work until notification is observed. Do not fix by increasing the timing window." ;
 triage:verification_source "https://github.com/randlee/sc-runtime/pull/118#issuecomment-6649234798" .

triage:C5_QA2_RBP_C5_003 a triage:Finding ;
 triage:id "RBP-C5-003" ;
 triage:severity "important" ;
 triage:reviewer "rust-best-practices-agent" ;
 triage:status "implemented_pending_qa" ;
 triage:reviewed_commit "f676f940af81b09315366feb4ca644b86a3d2485" ;
 triage:file "crates/sc-cron/src/sqlite_scope.rs" ;
 triage:issue "Provider causes are still discarded when the operation also observes cancellation or expiry." ;
 triage:action "Keep the context error for cancellation/deadline classification and actual transaction outcome, but retain the original provider failure in Error::source whenever operation() returned Err. Keep public diagnostics value-free. Add a causal case that cancels the context inside the operation before returning a provider error with a private canary, then verifies both classification and the deepest source." ;
 triage:verification_source "https://github.com/randlee/sc-runtime/pull/118#issuecomment-6649234798" .

triage:C5_QA2_RSH_C5_001 a triage:Finding ;
 triage:id "RSH-C5-001" ;
 triage:severity "important" ;
 triage:reviewer "rust-service-hardening-agent" ;
 triage:status "implemented_pending_qa" ;
 triage:reviewed_commit "f676f940af81b09315366feb4ca644b86a3d2485" ;
 triage:file "crates/sc-cron/src/sqlite_cooperative_lifecycle_tests.rs" ;
 triage:issue "The ordinary-thread notifier production fix is present, but its required causal regression can pass without exercising the retained-runtime timer." ;
 triage:action "Make the regression causally establish timer installation before the grace cutoff or use a controlled clock/explicit branch witness. Preserve a held admitted native operation and prove status changes before releasing it. Do not increase the timing window or use retries." ;
